    description: "Found by the 2026-10-25 docstring staleness audit (dev 95c0ff7b93): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier confirmed it by reading the code itself (a repro where stated). Severity is not asserted; impact not measured on the corpus.\n\n- bitbake.py: symbol ids are keyed by name only, so repeated assignments collide -- evidence: bitbake.py:77 `return f\"bitbake:{path}:0-0:{name}:{kind}\"`; repro on `DEPENDS = \"a\"\\nDEPENDS += \"b\"` prints `SYM bitbake:a.bb:0-0:DEPENDS:variable ... DEPENDS = a` and `SYM bitbake:a.bb:0-0:DEPENDS:variable ... DEPENDS = b` (two Symbols, one id).\n\nNot asserted: that the fix is the one sketched above, or that no other language has the same shape."  # 5085
